## Aug 14 batch (ATOBench 2608.12996 · MARC 2608.13476 · YAVIN 2608.13496)

- **K278 ATOBench (lab + audit)** — deceptive target observations break the verification chain: an agent can stay **active** (repeat probes, produce a plausible report) after its evidence path has broken. When evaluating pentest agents on a lab, report **process-level evidence handling** (later actions → recovered evidence → stopping → report grounding), not only final findings / ASR; treat activity and verification as orthogonal. **Authorized lab targets only** — no LIVE third-party targets. REFERENCE (repo is a placeholder); pattern steal for verification-chain eval.

